  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_usd0015e7j](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_usd0015e7j) Magnitude 5.3 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 16 2026 76km N of Ruteng. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.9399 longitude 120.5995. It impacted 89749 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
